  <para style="h">Ayọhọ Ñwed Yọọn Ita</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ayọhọ Ñwed Yọọn Ita</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ayọhọ Ñwed Yọọn Ita</para>
  <para style="toc3">3Yọọn</para>
  <para style="mt1">Ayọhọ Ñwed Yọọn Ita</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="3JN 1" />
  <para style="s1">Ekọọm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="3JN 1:1" />Ñkpisọñ, ami Yọọn, nnọ ñwed ami esọk edima ufan mmi Keyọs, a-ami mmaaha ke akpanikọ.<verse eid="3JN 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="3JN 1:2" />Edima ufan mmi, akam mmi ado yak afo aba ke nsọñidem, yak ñkpọ anyʌñ ufọn fiin kpa ukem naña afọn ye ukpọñ mfo. <verse eid="3JN 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="3JN 1:3" />Mmaanem esịd eti-eti adikop naña usʌk mme andinịm ke akpanikọ enọ ntiense ebo ke afo amenam akpanikọ anyʌñ asʌk aka iso asaña ke akpanikọ. <verse eid="3JN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="3JN 1:4" />Inemesịd mmi anekke akpon ke adikop ke nditọ mmi esaña ke usʌñ akpanikọ.<verse eid="3JN 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Etooro Keyọs</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="3JN 1:5" />Edima ufan, afo amenam akpanikọ ke utom Abasi a-afo anamma anọọ nditọeka<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke usem Greek (adelfọi) a-awuọñọke </char><char style="fq" closed="false">nditọeka </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">ideen ye ibaan</char><char style="ft" closed="false">anyʌñ asʌk ada anọ ideen ye ibaan e-enịmme Krais ke akpanikọ ke atu ubon Abasi.</char></note> ke Krais, akpesʌkado a-ammọ edooho isenawo mfo. <verse eid="3JN 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="3JN 1:6" />Ammọ e-enọ ikọ ntiense ke atu ikọd Abasi ebaña ima mfo. Mbọk sio ammọ unyọñ ke usʌñ a-anemme Abasi esịd. <verse eid="3JN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="3JN 1:7" />Sia aketo ke ntak Anyịñ ado ammọ ewuọ ekaa, ibọọhọ unwam ndomokeed ito mbon i-imiidiọọñọke Abasi. <verse eid="3JN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="3JN 1:8" />Ndin ana ñnyịn isịn unwam inọ utọ ibon ado, nọ ikeene ido nsaña utom usuan etob akpanikọ.<verse eid="3JN 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="3JN 1:9" />Ami mmaawet ñwed nnọ esọk ufọkabasi, ado Diotrefes, a-amaaha isido adaiso, ikinyịmmeke adidaara ñnyịn. <verse eid="3JN 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="3JN 1:10" />Ke ntoro ami mmaadi, ñyaanam ediọọñọ se anye anam, ye ndiọi ikọ inua a-anye atañña idian ñnyịn. Anye iyʌkkọke ke ado, a-asịn adidaara mme andinịm ke akpanikọ mfen e-ediighe. Idooho ado kpọd, anye akaiso adibiọọñọ mbon se ikpinyịmme adinịm ke akpanikọ, abịn ammọ asịññe ke ufọkabasi.<verse eid="3JN 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="3JN 1:11" />Edima ufan, kuukeene udʌk usʌñ idiọọk, ado keene se ido eti. Awo a-anamma se ifọn ato Abasi. Awo akeedodo se inam ndiọiñkpọ idiọọñọke Abasi. <verse eid="3JN 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="3JN 1:12" />Afịd awo e-etañ nti ikọ ebaña Demitrus, kpa akpanikọ ke idem amọ. Ñnyịn ñko imitañ nti ikọ ibaña anye, ndin afo amediọọñọ ke ikọ ntiense ñnyịn ado akpanikọ.<verse eid="3JN 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Akpatre Ekọọm</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="3JN 1:13" />Mmenie uwak ñkpọ se ñkpewet unọọ fiin, ado ñyemme adidat ñwed ye mmọọññwed ñwet. <verse eid="3JN 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="3JN 1:14" />Mmenie idodanyen ke idiikpeeneke ñyaadukịt fiin iso ye iso, ndin iyainie nneme iso ye iso.<verse eid="3JN 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="3JN 1:15" />Yak emem aba ye afo.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="3JN 1:15" />
  <para style="p" vid="3JN 1:15">Mme ufan ke umi enọ ekọọm. Kọọm mme ufan ñnyịn do ke anyịñ ke anyịñ.<verse eid="3JN 1:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="3JN 1" />
</usx>